# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# ── Virtual environments ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
.venv*/
venv/
env/

# ── Vendored runtime ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `sih-har-isro/.runtime/site-packages` is a full checked-in copy of torch,
# numpy, sympy and friends - roughly 300 MB, and the reason a clone of this
# repo is ~330 MB when the actual project source is under 1 MB. Dependencies
# belong in requirements.txt, which already lists them; a committed
# site-packages is also platform- and Python-version-locked (these are
# cp312 Windows builds), so it cannot serve the offline-deployment purpose it
# looks like it was meant for on any other machine.
#
# NOTE: adding it here stops it growing further but does NOT shrink existing
# clones - the objects are already in history. To actually reclaim the space
# someone has to rewrite history (git filter-repo --path sih-har-isro/.runtime
# --invert-paths) and force-push, which is a decision for the repo owner
# because it invalidates every existing clone.
.runtime/
tmp/pip/

# ── Generated datasets and renders ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Regenerate with:
#   blender --background --factory-startup --python blender/render_dataset.py -- --plan study
sih-har-isro/dataset/blender/
sih-har-isro/dataset/blender_smoke/
sih-har-isro/dataset/sequences_*/
sih-har-isro/dataset/annotated/
sih-har-isro/build/
sih-har-isro/recordings/*.mp4

# Keep the small ground-truth-only artefacts that document a run
!sih-har-isro/dataset/**/meta.json
!sih-har-isro/dataset/**/index.json

# ── Blender ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.blend1
*.blend2

# ── Runtime output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
sih-har-isro/config/tuned_overrides.json
*.crash.txt

# ── OS / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# ── MediaPipe pose bundles ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# lite + full are committed via Git LFS so a fresh clone is genuinely offline-
# capable (the PS requires a standalone offline system). 'heavy' is a 30 MB
# optional accuracy upgrade - fetch it on demand rather than paying for it in
# every clone:  python tools/fetch_pose_model.py --variant heavy
sih-har-isro/models/mediapipe/pose_landmarker_heavy.task
